<para>This routine converts a variable declaration of the form:</para><para>TYPE i, j = J0, k = K0, ...;</para><para>to:</para><para>TYPE i, j, k, ...; { //  j = J0; k = K0; ... }</para><para>and returns a pointer to the SgBasicBlock at &quot;@RET&quot;.</para><para>In addition to creating a new SgBasicBlock, this routine modifies the original SgVariableDeclaration by removing all SgAssignInitializers. </para>        </detaileddescription>
